('classic-glitter-boy-qgb-100', 'Main Body', 770, 'Depleting the main body shuts the unit down completely. LASER WEAPONS DO HALF DAMAGE - the chrome-surfaced alloy is the whole Glitter Boy line''s defining feature, and outside Free Quebec only Triax has ever duplicated it.', 8),
