('glitter-boy-side-kick-qpa-98', 'Main Jet Thruster (1)', 90, 'Small and difficult target: called shot only, attacker -3 to strike, or -6 while the suit is leaping or flying. Destroying it ends flight and halves the leap.', 1),
('glitter-boy-side-kick-qpa-98', 'Lower Jet Thrusters (2, back)', 30, 'each. Called shot only, -3 to strike, -6 while leaping or flying. Destroying one cuts flight speed 20% and halves the combat bonuses while flying or leaping; destroying both ends flight, halves those bonuses and caps the leap at 12 feet.', 2),
('glitter-boy-side-kick-qpa-98', 'Leg Directional Thrusters (4)', 15, 'each. Called shot only, -3 to strike, -6 while leaping or flying. Destroying two or more costs 10% speed and -1 to strike and dodge while flying.', 3),
