('glitter-boy-side-kick-qpa-98', 'QST-98 Grenade Launcher (1)', 100, 'THE BOOK LISTS THIS IN THE ARMOR''S M.D.C. TABLE while its Weapon Systems section says "No weapons are integrated into the power armor of the Side Kick" and treats the launcher as hand-held. An internal inconsistency, recorded rather than resolved.', 5),
('glitter-boy-side-kick-qpa-98', 'Head', 100, 'Destroying it carries a 01-70% chance of knocking the pilot out; a pilot who stays conscious loses all combat bonuses. Called shot only, attacker -3 to strike, or -6 while the suit is leaping or flying.', 6),
('glitter-boy-side-kick-qpa-98', 'Main Body', 280, 'Depleting the main body shuts the armor down. LASER RESISTANT LIKE THE GLITTER BOY - the book words it that way rather than repeating the half-damage line, and it means the same thing.', 7),
('tarantula-glitter-boy-qgb-3-30', 'QST-333 Shaker Cannon (1)', 175, 'READ FROM A 200 DPI RENDER. The cached text layer gives 115 here; printed 95 is glyph-corrupt and this is one of two figures it damages. See BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT.md F36.', 1),
